  "description": "Library-agnostic source generator for automatic Mermaid pipeline diagrams. Add [ResultFlow] to any fluent method — works with REslava.Result, ErrorOr, FluentResults, LanguageExt, or any fluent Result library. Generates typed flow diagrams with async markers, success type travel, and named error edges. Zero runtime overhead. For REslava.Result users wanting richer diagrams with typed error body scanning, see REslava.Result.Flow.",
